@* A name on a generic div makes the sticky a group, unless the page writes a role of its own; aria-labelledby
   names it just as well, and a tag with a role of its own keeps it. *@

<BitSticky AriaLabel="Filters" role="toolbar" />
<BitSticky aria-labelledby="sticky-title" />
<BitSticky Element="nav" AriaLabel="Contents" />
<BitSticky Element="span" AriaLabel="Inline" />
